LOCUS       pSC101_ori_biobrick      223 bp    DNA              UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  The SpeI-free BioBrick form of the pSC101 origin: the native origin
            with two changes (T22A, A23T) that remove the ACTAGT SpeI site at
            its bases 20-25..
